  "textBlocks": [
    "Hello Bravehearts\nIn today’s lesson we are taking a break from Moses and the Israelites\nWe are looking at wearing God’s Armour\nDo you know what armour is?",
    "VIDEO TIME",
    "CRAFT & GAME TIME",
    "You will need a piece of cardboard and an old magazine, newspaper or paper\nMAKE YOUR SHIELD OF FAITH \nthen crumple some old pieces of paper into balls \nand ask you mom or dad to throw them toward you\nWHILE YOU USE YOUR SHIELD TO STOP THEM\n\nSend us some photos of your shields",
    "SONG TIME",
    "PRAYER TIME\nThank you Lord Jesus for making me me\nI want to be in your army\nAnd tell my friends about you\nAmen",
    "SEE YOU NEXT WEEK"
  ]
